# Layout note: everything that is not the site lives in _dev/ and is tracked
# on purpose. _dev/_generate.py is the source of truth and the .html files are
# its output; _dev/qa.py and _dev/qa2.py are the checks. They are kept off the
# web by _redirects, not by being kept out of git.
